# Compiled binaries
bin/
dist/
*.exe
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib

# Stray binaries from `go build ./cmd/<x>/`, which writes them to the
# CWD instead of bin/ and names them after the DIRECTORY — so the
# leftovers are `controller` and `cli`, not the `voodu-controller` /
# `voodu` names the Makefile and goreleaser produce. Anchored to the
# repo root so they can never shadow a real path deeper in the tree.
/controller
/cli

# Test and coverage artifacts
coverage.out
coverage.html
*.test
*.prof

